0 and differs by of order a millikelvin here. DISTILLED WATER, NOT THIS BENCH'S SUSPENSION (particle_suspension_a); applying this index to that is a substitution the caller makes. RELATION TO THE SODIUM-LINE ENTRY. water_refractive_index_589_26nm_293k stands and is not superseded: it is a different wavelength and both are measured. This one is the wavelength A6 actually collects at.",
